            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A thin film transistor, comprising: a first gate electrode (120); a second gate electrode (132) overlapping the first gate electrode (120); an oxide semiconductor layer (127, 128) between the first gate electrode (120) and the second gate electrode (132); a first insulating layer (122) between the first gate electrode (120) and the oxide semiconductor layer (127, 128); a second insulating layer (130) between the oxide semiconductor layer (127, 128) and the second gate electrode (132); and a conductive layer (124a, 126a) separated from the first gate electrode (120) and the second gate electrode (132) and sandwiched between the first insulating layer (122) and the oxide semiconductor layer (127, 128), wherein the oxide semiconductor layer (127, 128) comprises: a channel region (128) overlapping the second gate electrode (132), and at least one low resistance region (127) adjacent to the channel region (128) and including a region that is in contact with the conductive layer (124a, 126a), wherein the at least one low resistance region (127) includes an offset region (W) between the channel region (128) and the region in contact with the conductive layer (124a, 126a), wherein the at least one low resistance region (127) is formed self-aligned by irradiating a laser beam or an ion beam from second gate electrode side.</p>
            </abstract>
